WEBVTT

01:31.700 --> 01:34.930
[NORTHWARD]

01:35.100 --> 01:37.050
[Episode 6]

01:48.259 --> 01:49.330
Why did you try to wreck the car?

01:51.130 --> 01:52.880
Crippled Sun didn't pay his debts.

01:53.220 --> 01:54.810
My mom cried all night at home.

01:54.910 --> 01:56.200
I just couldn't take it anymore.

01:59.110 --> 02:01.380
The police's talk with you that day did work.

02:01.740 --> 02:03.050
If this were before,

02:03.120 --> 02:04.710
you'd have smashed the car for sure,

02:04.740 --> 02:06.350
and then been caught on camera,

02:06.350 --> 02:07.540
making your parents pay for it.

02:10.070 --> 02:11.220
Honestly, I was worried about that.

02:12.800 --> 02:14.750
At worst, I'd take responsibility myself.

02:16.910 --> 02:18.120
I just feel that

02:18.670 --> 02:20.030
I'm about to turn eighteen,

02:20.390 --> 02:21.560
and I wanna change the way I live

02:22.900 --> 02:24.390
instead of acting recklessly.

02:24.870 --> 02:26.060
Siyi was right.

02:26.550 --> 02:28.400
I should seriously think about my future path.

02:29.030 --> 02:30.400
Don't worry,

02:30.400 --> 02:31.870
you'll be fine.

02:33.590 --> 02:34.990
You'll make a big fortune in the future.

02:38.390 --> 02:39.390
How do you know that?

02:40.030 --> 02:41.630
I've known it since childhood.

02:42.180 --> 02:43.790
I knew it from the first time

02:43.790 --> 02:45.390
I helped my mom watch the stall

02:45.390 --> 02:46.240
on the street.

02:52.640 --> 02:54.230
Three youtiao.

02:54.550 --> 02:56.220
Three bowls of soy milk.

02:56.350 --> 02:58.070
One yuan and fifty cents in total.

02:58.070 --> 02:58.680
Pay now.

02:59.850 --> 03:01.170
Pay for what?

03:01.910 --> 03:03.430
No payment, no food!

03:03.430 --> 03:03.990
What are you doing?

03:03.990 --> 03:04.950
Give me the youtiao.

03:04.950 --> 03:06.100
Give me that!

03:06.550 --> 03:07.480
Give it to me!

03:07.480 --> 03:08.720
What's wrong, Fenghua?

03:08.830 --> 03:10.270
Madam, he's not paying!

03:10.270 --> 03:10.670
I'll pay.

03:10.670 --> 03:11.710
Mom, you don't need to pay.

03:12.430 --> 03:13.420
Why?

03:13.870 --> 03:15.070
I gave her mom a good idea.

03:15.070 --> 03:17.060
And she said I could eat anything for free.

03:17.270 --> 03:17.910
What idea?

03:17.910 --> 03:19.030
Why don't I know about this?

03:19.390 --> 03:20.660
I told your mom that,

03:19.579 --> 03:23.380
[Breakfast]

03:21.190 --> 03:22.590
with the crowds on Flower Street

03:22.790 --> 03:24.110
and everything being so cheap,

03:24.150 --> 03:26.230
despite a whole morning of her hard work,

03:26.290 --> 03:27.530
she would only

03:27.590 --> 03:29.480
earn a little bit of money.

03:29.500 --> 03:30.540
I suggested

03:30.579 --> 03:32.180
she prepare the soy milk first

03:32.200 --> 03:34.250
and then hire someone to sell it at the school gate.

03:34.280 --> 03:36.400
To sell various flavors of soy milk,

03:36.430 --> 03:38.380
like red bean, chocolate, and such.

03:38.420 --> 03:40.510
The daily turnover is basically

03:40.530 --> 03:41.560
over 100 yuan.

03:41.600 --> 03:42.430
Really?

03:42.440 --> 03:44.160
Yes! It's true, of course.

03:44.640 --> 03:46.300
Just one casual idea from you,

03:46.470 --> 03:48.650
and my mom earned several hundred more each month.

03:49.020 --> 03:50.450
She always praised you at home.

03:50.480 --> 03:51.520
It drove me mad.

03:52.790 --> 03:54.660
That was on your dimwittedness,

03:55.190 --> 03:55.980
not my fault.

03:59.650 --> 04:02.560
Most people are dimwitted compared to you.

04:08.650 --> 04:09.360
Fenghua,

04:10.100 --> 04:11.110
I don't have money.

04:12.940 --> 04:14.600
I'm not asking you for money.

04:14.820 --> 04:15.920
Look how scared you are.

04:16.910 --> 04:19.019
You've never praised me like this before.

04:19.160 --> 04:20.560
It's indeed scary.

04:22.120 --> 04:23.120
I didn't praise you

04:23.150 --> 04:24.310
just to keep you humble.

04:25.820 --> 04:26.980
Then why now?

04:29.670 --> 04:30.520
It'll be too late

04:31.760 --> 04:32.670
If I don't praise you

04:33.190 --> 04:33.980
before we graduate.

04:39.760 --> 04:40.950
How could it be too late?

04:44.150 --> 04:45.090
Well...

04:45.340 --> 04:47.750
Who knows where we'll each end up in the future?

04:48.700 --> 04:50.210
Maybe we'll go our separate ways

04:50.250 --> 04:51.420
right after graduation.

04:59.210 --> 05:00.620
I'm definitely going to Beijing.

05:02.510 --> 05:03.910
So are

05:04.190 --> 05:05.400
Xingchi and Haikuo

05:06.030 --> 05:06.860
What about you?

05:11.210 --> 05:12.380
Depends on my mood.

05:13.040 --> 05:14.120
Do you want me to go with you?

05:16.270 --> 05:17.150
Nope.

05:18.350 --> 05:20.100
Then I'll go!

05:20.200 --> 05:22.080
I'll follow you wherever you go.

05:22.110 --> 05:23.640
You make money, and I'll make money too!

05:23.650 --> 05:24.330
You hit rock bottom,

05:24.370 --> 05:25.410
and I'll sit by and watch the show.

05:25.430 --> 05:26.310
Do I owe you something?

05:26.350 --> 05:27.430
Yes, you do!

05:28.370 --> 05:30.700
You promised to buy me a car when we were kids.

05:30.840 --> 05:31.990
When did I say that?

05:31.990 --> 05:33.390
Do you have any proof?

05:33.630 --> 05:35.100
Fine...

05:35.750 --> 05:36.750
I promise you.

05:38.670 --> 05:39.760
I'll buy you one.

05:40.820 --> 05:42.480
When I get my first paycheck,

05:43.760 --> 05:45.380
I'll buy you a car.

05:45.750 --> 05:46.510
What kind of car?

05:49.020 --> 05:50.100
A three-wheeler.

05:50.470 --> 05:52.290
Then you can drive it to make money.

05:52.950 --> 05:55.610
Five yuan to Flower Street, twenty to Huai'an.

05:56.360 --> 05:57.270
That's so little!

05:57.270 --> 05:57.950
Flower Street...

05:57.990 --> 05:59.230
Five yuan to Flower Street...

06:04.400 --> 06:06.440
If you really strike it rich one day,

06:06.680 --> 06:08.140
can you promise me one thing?

06:08.850 --> 06:09.750
What is it?

06:09.800 --> 06:11.460
Invite Jay Chou to our home

06:11.490 --> 06:13.020
and have him sing a song just for me,

06:13.040 --> 06:14.460
"Adorable Lady."

06:17.820 --> 06:19.660
Do you really think I'll make it one day?

06:20.000 --> 06:20.750
Of course!

06:22.990 --> 06:24.720
I've always believed

06:25.340 --> 06:27.500
you can definitely work miracles.

06:30.720 --> 06:31.720
So,

06:32.830 --> 06:34.909
please have faith in yourself too.

06:47.580 --> 06:48.380
Fenghua,

06:48.659 --> 06:50.090
how about I lend you some money?

06:50.240 --> 06:51.240
Why?

06:51.790 --> 06:53.690
To buy new pants and ditch your worn-out ones.

06:53.710 --> 06:54.490
They're embarrassing.

06:56.470 --> 06:57.670
You know nothing

06:57.810 --> 06:59.090
about fashion.

06:59.120 --> 07:00.970
Have you heard of Paris Fashion Week?

07:00.990 --> 07:02.820
How could I not know about Paris?

07:03.070 --> 07:04.490
There's Notre Dame.

07:05.320 --> 07:06.780
And you're that

07:06.800 --> 07:08.920
Quasimodo.

07:11.110 --> 07:12.080
You...

07:12.280 --> 07:13.640
You love talking back, huh?

07:13.710 --> 07:14.510
You look so much like him!

07:14.510 --> 07:16.040
Would it kill you not to talk back?

07:16.190 --> 07:19.480
You're the Quasimodo on Flower Street.

07:19.890 --> 07:22.120
Stop there!

07:23.430 --> 07:25.170
Don't hit me!

07:25.590 --> 07:26.890
You deserve this!

07:28.010 --> 07:29.150
Quasimodo!

07:31.810 --> 07:33.140
Stop there!

07:52.630 --> 07:53.880
Don't you feel cold at night?

07:55.570 --> 07:56.430
What's up?

07:58.530 --> 07:59.260
Nothing,

08:00.490 --> 08:01.410
I just passed by

08:02.060 --> 08:03.180
and wanted to drop in on you.

08:14.220 --> 08:15.980
I got into a fight with someone today.

08:18.180 --> 08:19.300
Did you win or lose?

08:20.510 --> 08:21.770
I lost.

08:22.480 --> 08:23.710
It was a total fiasco.

08:24.440 --> 08:25.680
I was utterly crushed.

08:47.730 --> 08:49.100
I don't think I've ever won

08:50.860 --> 08:52.570
in my entire life.

08:55.870 --> 08:56.960
Isn't it pathetic?

09:01.210 --> 09:03.010
I can't even respect myself.

09:20.540 --> 09:21.610
Hello, who is this?

09:21.760 --> 09:22.890
Hello, Zhimei.

09:22.920 --> 09:24.610
This is Granny Ma.

09:24.720 --> 09:25.780
Granny Ma!

09:25.850 --> 09:26.710
Excuse me, sir.

09:26.750 --> 09:27.860
I need to take a call.

09:31.350 --> 09:32.360
Granny Ma,

09:32.650 --> 09:33.940
hello, what's the matter?

09:34.740 --> 09:36.160
Zhimei,

09:36.190 --> 09:37.710
How are you doing?

09:37.740 --> 09:38.940
I'm doing well

09:39.110 --> 09:40.390
and out here filming.

09:40.900 --> 09:41.850
What's wrong?

09:41.970 --> 09:43.640
Did something happen at home?

09:43.680 --> 09:44.880
No...

09:45.670 --> 09:46.390
Nothing happened.

09:46.430 --> 09:48.070
I just missed you

09:48.070 --> 09:49.860
and wanted to hear your voice.

09:50.430 --> 09:51.460
Are you sure everything's okay?

09:51.760 --> 09:52.880
Yeah, everything's fine.

09:54.070 --> 09:56.290
When are you coming back?

10:01.620 --> 10:02.770
It should be soon.

10:03.060 --> 10:04.660
I'll be back once I wrap things up.

10:07.030 --> 10:07.950
Okay,

10:08.170 --> 10:09.680
I see.

10:10.080 --> 10:12.520
Well, filming must be quite tiring.

10:12.650 --> 10:14.560
Make sure to take care of yourself.

10:15.040 --> 10:16.110
Thank you, Granny Ma.

10:16.960 --> 10:18.160
Then I'll hang up. Bye.

10:18.230 --> 10:19.350
Goodbye...

10:25.760 --> 10:26.420
Here.

10:26.510 --> 10:27.520
Got it, Granny Ma.

10:27.540 --> 10:28.540
Thank you.

10:29.560 --> 10:30.540
Take care, Granny Ma.

10:46.400 --> 10:47.460
Listen, Xu Peng,

10:47.690 --> 10:48.650
you should either zero in on it

10:48.670 --> 10:49.920
or just quit!

10:50.380 --> 10:51.290
Do you hear me?

10:54.640 --> 10:55.200
Chen Zhen,

10:55.460 --> 10:56.660
tell them all

10:56.680 --> 10:58.180
to go home if they don't wanna work.

11:02.150 --> 11:03.190
Yanlin.

11:06.520 --> 11:07.230
Granny Ma.

11:08.440 --> 11:09.760
Are you here for some water?

11:09.790 --> 11:11.980
Yes, I came to ask you for some water.

11:12.280 --> 11:12.930
Perfect timing.

11:13.380 --> 11:14.860
I just got a new batch of Pu'er tea.

11:14.890 --> 11:16.440
You're in for a real treat.

11:16.450 --> 11:17.250
Don't bother.

11:17.270 --> 11:19.140
-I can't tell the difference in taste anyway.
-It's okay!

11:19.170 --> 11:20.330
Come, please take a seat first.

11:20.830 --> 11:21.350
Okay.

11:21.380 --> 11:22.290
Just a moment.

11:27.230 --> 11:28.920
Why are you still standing there?

11:29.820 --> 11:30.630
Get back to work!

11:36.430 --> 11:38.010
Look how beautiful

11:38.150 --> 11:39.060
the tea color is!

11:39.990 --> 11:41.350
Just like amber.

11:41.810 --> 11:43.140
Dry-stored aged tea.

11:44.100 --> 11:45.320
I don't understand what you're saying.

11:45.360 --> 11:47.790
I just find the tea kinda crystal-clear.

11:47.870 --> 11:48.840
You don't need to understand.

11:48.900 --> 11:49.980
Just enjoy it.

11:50.000 --> 11:51.200
Especially at your age,

11:51.230 --> 11:53.750
drinking this aged Pu'er is particularly good for your stomach.

11:54.060 --> 11:55.040
Care for my stomach

11:55.200 --> 11:56.270
and care for your liver.

11:57.130 --> 11:58.500
Are we sick fellows now?

12:02.740 --> 12:03.920
Yanlin,

12:05.540 --> 12:06.990
I'm actually here

12:07.030 --> 12:09.560
to talk to you about Zhimei.

12:11.210 --> 12:12.010
What's up with her?

12:13.150 --> 12:14.540
I heard

12:15.010 --> 12:17.930
she's having a tough time as an actress in Hengdian.

12:19.110 --> 12:19.920
It is tough.

12:21.710 --> 12:23.910
But the thing is, no one forced her to work there.

12:25.330 --> 12:27.250
I called her.

12:27.900 --> 12:29.120
She didn't say anything about it,

12:29.160 --> 12:30.880
only sharing the good news, not the bad.

12:30.960 --> 12:33.010
You know her personality.

12:33.040 --> 12:35.030
Proud and stubborn.

12:35.810 --> 12:38.450
No matter how much she suffers, she won't say a word.

12:39.950 --> 12:41.850
She must be going through a lot.

12:42.080 --> 12:44.070
You've been married for years.

12:44.110 --> 12:46.220
No grudges for too long,

12:46.250 --> 12:47.190
right?

12:47.220 --> 12:50.170
As a woman, she's at her most vulnerable right now.

12:50.190 --> 12:52.280
She needs your care.

12:52.500 --> 12:54.510
Just say something sweet,

12:54.690 --> 12:57.090
and it'll keep her in a good mood all day.

12:57.110 --> 12:58.690
Even just a few words.

13:03.920 --> 13:12.010
[By the Canal]

13:06.290 --> 13:07.710
Damn it.

13:20.770 --> 13:22.530
You won because I let you.

13:23.070 --> 13:24.030
Haikuo,

13:24.140 --> 13:25.760
when will your mom come back?

13:26.630 --> 13:27.690
I dunno.

13:27.910 --> 13:29.850
I hope she doesn't come back.

13:30.140 --> 13:31.100
Why?

13:31.350 --> 13:33.860
My mom will keep bickering with my dad if she's back.

13:34.190 --> 13:36.240
And I don't know how to mediate.

13:36.270 --> 13:37.180
It's just depressing.

13:37.230 --> 13:38.190
I think...

13:38.950 --> 13:40.390
This is still your dad's fault.

13:41.180 --> 13:42.400
Why?

13:42.530 --> 13:44.650
Look at Flower Street now.

13:45.180 --> 13:47.080
So many people have left.

13:47.920 --> 13:49.590
People always strive for better.

13:49.620 --> 13:51.030
What's wrong with that?

13:51.590 --> 13:52.830
I just hope

13:52.920 --> 13:56.170
the two of them can have a good talk

13:56.200 --> 13:57.430
and sort things out.

13:57.460 --> 13:59.590
Don't end up as enemies even if they get divorced

14:01.100 --> 14:02.960
If they really get divorced,

14:03.510 --> 14:04.570
who would you go with?

14:04.590 --> 14:05.200
My dad,

14:05.430 --> 14:06.630
of course!

14:07.840 --> 14:08.640
Why?

14:09.930 --> 14:10.980
My dad

14:12.320 --> 14:13.460
is headstrong

14:14.020 --> 14:15.540
and tends to overthink things.

14:16.580 --> 14:17.630
I need to look after him.

14:17.710 --> 14:19.030
Otherwise, he might be overwhelmed.

14:19.580 --> 14:20.840
I'll wait

14:19.850 --> 14:22.560
♫When the moon hangs in the sky♫

14:20.980 --> 14:21.990
until he

14:22.030 --> 14:24.150
smiles more often.

14:23.240 --> 14:25.000
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

14:23.680 --> 14:27.950
[Clock Fixing]

14:24.160 --> 14:25.090
Then I can leave.

14:25.770 --> 14:28.310
♫Who is still by your side?♫

14:27.390 --> 14:28.570
That's true.

14:28.960 --> 14:30.590
I've never really

14:29.680 --> 14:33.140
♫As time passes♫

14:30.680 --> 14:32.390
seen your dad smile since I was little.

14:33.630 --> 14:34.310
When I was a kid,

14:34.330 --> 14:35.320
my dad and I

14:34.610 --> 14:38.390
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

14:35.350 --> 14:37.580
watched my mom perform Kunqu operas on stage.

14:37.900 --> 14:39.350
When the audience cheered,

14:39.350 --> 14:40.590
my dad would smile

14:41.070 --> 14:43.040
with an undisguised pride

14:41.680 --> 14:45.070
♫When youthful company fades, leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

14:43.320 --> 14:45.760
on his face.

14:45.820 --> 14:49.130
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

14:50.950 --> 14:54.500
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

14:52.350 --> 14:53.110
Dad.

14:53.290 --> 14:54.300
Welcome back.

14:55.840 --> 14:59.410
♫Of sweet dreams♫

15:04.590 --> 15:07.300
♫Life is long♫

15:08.920 --> 15:11.800
♫No need to dwell♫

15:13.260 --> 15:16.570
♫Like moonlight♫

15:18.220 --> 15:21.820
♫Don't forget♫

15:21.300 --> 15:23.000
How are you doing over there?

15:22.780 --> 15:25.900
♫Life is long♫

15:23.800 --> 15:25.240
Is it tiring?

15:27.360 --> 15:30.370
♫No need to dwell♫

15:32.410 --> 15:35.440
♫Like moonlight♫

15:37.330 --> 15:40.700
♫The old times♫

15:42.750 --> 15:43.670
What are you looking at?

15:43.700 --> 15:46.010
Look at this starry sky.

15:47.080 --> 15:48.100
I've never

15:48.150 --> 15:50.990
seen so many stars in Beijing before.

15:53.750 --> 15:55.130
It's a better place here, right?

15:57.350 --> 15:58.360
From now on,

15:58.390 --> 16:01.130
we can watch the stars here every day.

16:00.920 --> 16:03.060
♫When the moon hangs in the sky♫

16:04.200 --> 16:05.790
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

16:06.720 --> 16:09.260
♫Who is still by your side?♫

16:10.930 --> 16:14.450
♫As time passes♫

16:15.570 --> 16:18.870
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

16:22.480 --> 16:26.150
♫When youthful company fades, leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

16:26.890 --> 16:30.400
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

16:32.020 --> 16:35.680
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

16:37.280 --> 16:41.130
♫Dreamland and dreams♫

16:37.800 --> 16:41.920
[Select] [Return]

16:40.990 --> 16:43.450
The stars on Flower Street don't look as stunning in the pic.

16:44.340 --> 16:46.030
They're more breathtaking in reality.

16:45.550 --> 16:48.400
♫Life is long♫

16:50.030 --> 16:52.930
♫No need to dwell♫

16:54.350 --> 16:57.550
♫Like moonlight♫

16:59.180 --> 17:02.660
♫Don't forget♫

17:03.740 --> 17:06.760
♫Life is long♫

17:08.319 --> 17:11.319
♫No need to dwell♫

17:10.400 --> 17:13.400
Hope you, our son, and Dad all take good care of yourselves.

17:13.369 --> 17:16.530
♫Like moonlight♫

17:13.920 --> 17:15.460
Remember to take your meds on time.

17:18.290 --> 17:21.849
♫The old times♫

17:24.369 --> 17:33.690
♫Pear blossoms bloom in spring...♫

17:24.690 --> 17:27.589
♫Life is long♫

17:29.160 --> 17:32.190
♫No need to dwell♫

17:33.640 --> 17:36.890
♫Like moonlight♫

17:38.340 --> 17:41.830
♫Don't forget♫

17:40.430 --> 17:42.600
Hey, let's get right to it...

17:43.100 --> 17:46.090
♫Life is long♫

17:45.540 --> 17:47.200
Leave that alone!

17:47.300 --> 17:50.600
♫No need to dwell♫

17:52.460 --> 17:55.730
♫Like moonlight♫

17:57.280 --> 18:00.730
♫The old times♫

18:02.120 --> 18:03.550
Let's go. Bye.

18:12.840 --> 18:17.980
♫Every emotion in my life♫

19:12.790 --> 19:14.300
What are you drawing?

19:15.160 --> 19:15.870
Take a guess.

19:17.510 --> 19:19.160
Chūka Ichiban?

19:22.410 --> 19:23.440
Screw you.

19:23.460 --> 19:24.830
I'm drawing Chris.

19:25.080 --> 19:26.970
Which Chris?

19:27.350 --> 19:29.230
The Chris in my heart, of course.

19:32.890 --> 19:35.000
Zhou Bichang's a better singer than her.

19:36.700 --> 19:37.620
Say that again.

19:39.150 --> 19:40.610
Sorry, I apologize...

19:40.740 --> 19:42.570
Your Chris sings the best.

19:45.020 --> 19:46.510
However, Fenghua,

19:48.310 --> 19:51.090
some people are colorblind

19:52.480 --> 19:53.450
due to genetic deficiency.

19:53.710 --> 19:54.670
And you

19:55.550 --> 19:56.510
are tone-deaf.

19:56.830 --> 19:58.150
You can't even sing well.

19:58.150 --> 19:59.400
You're still a fan?

20:02.330 --> 20:03.340
Shao Xingchi!

20:04.560 --> 20:07.350
Hit him! Hit him!

20:07.370 --> 20:08.770
Get him...

20:15.430 --> 20:16.430
Stop laughing.

20:16.600 --> 20:17.760
You're such a fool.

20:17.840 --> 20:18.750
Why did you mess with her?

20:18.750 --> 20:19.550
I didn't!

20:19.630 --> 20:21.660
She wouldn't have hit you if you hadn't messed with her.

20:21.700 --> 20:22.880
Whoever marries her in the future

20:22.910 --> 20:23.830
will be so cursed.

20:23.830 --> 20:24.830
So long as you don't marry her!

20:24.830 --> 20:26.130
Why do you care about the others?

20:31.970 --> 20:34.470
Nice ride. Whose is it?

20:36.830 --> 20:37.730
No touch!

20:38.950 --> 20:39.670
Don't touch my bike.

20:39.670 --> 20:40.890
Move, make way...

20:41.980 --> 20:42.970
Step back.

20:43.950 --> 20:45.950
Nice bike, but the owner's a bit lame.

20:47.700 --> 20:48.830
Just a crappy little bike.

20:48.830 --> 20:50.600
It barely hits 160 horsepower.

20:50.750 --> 20:52.110
An original import from Japan.

20:52.150 --> 20:53.540
Can't even find parts if it breaks down.

20:55.670 --> 20:56.530
Liang,

20:56.680 --> 20:57.820
would it kill you not to show off?

20:58.990 --> 21:00.220
I'm just too lazy

21:00.250 --> 21:02.010
to ride a bicycle to school anymore.

21:02.030 --> 21:03.790
My dad was originally going to buy me

21:04.130 --> 21:04.990
that Cadillac.

21:04.990 --> 21:06.310
I thought it was too flashy.

21:06.310 --> 21:07.460
So I got this small motorcycle instead.

21:07.510 --> 21:09.440
Not that expensive. Just two months of pocket money.

21:11.650 --> 21:13.040
If you can, just try to use

21:13.060 --> 21:14.570
your family's money for your entire life.

21:14.590 --> 21:17.120
Funny you should say that. I actually plan to do so.

21:17.160 --> 21:18.520
Living off your parents isn't sad.

21:18.550 --> 21:21.590
What's sad is not having parents to live off.

21:22.470 --> 21:23.470
Fenghua,

21:23.490 --> 21:25.240
Have you watched "A Moment of Romance"?

21:25.440 --> 21:26.480
Come and chase me!

21:27.750 --> 21:29.160
You little brat!

21:29.230 --> 21:30.390
You're asking for it again, huh?

21:30.400 --> 21:31.130
Fenghua!

21:31.060 --> 21:32.300
[Honghuai No. 7 High School]

21:35.430 --> 21:37.100
Serves you right!

21:40.300 --> 21:40.940
Serves you right!

21:40.960 --> 21:42.830
You really think you're Andy Lau?

21:43.560 --> 21:44.320
Just keep showing off.

21:44.350 --> 21:44.950
Fenghua!

21:44.950 --> 21:45.840
San Liangzi.

21:46.680 --> 21:47.710
Let's go.

21:47.780 --> 21:48.810
Do me a favor.

21:48.850 --> 21:50.000
Help me get the bike up.

21:51.370 --> 21:52.030
Please!

21:52.030 --> 21:53.190
How much is that bike?

21:53.230 --> 21:54.510
Don't buy one even if you can afford it.

21:54.510 --> 21:56.700
The first batch of motorcycle riders are all dead now.

22:14.040 --> 22:15.100
Hurry up.

22:16.400 --> 22:18.560
[Cyber Surfing Café]

22:16.800 --> 22:17.500
Fenghua!

22:17.520 --> 22:19.050
You go back first. We three will play some games.

22:19.090 --> 22:19.990
I'm in.

22:20.010 --> 22:20.790
Then go ahead.

22:20.860 --> 22:22.290
We three will go somewhere else.

22:22.950 --> 22:24.320
Xie Wanghe, what do you mean?

22:24.350 --> 22:25.640
Did I offend you or something?

22:26.310 --> 22:28.610
Well, we three just need space to talk about something.

22:28.640 --> 22:29.700
Talk about what?

22:30.220 --> 22:31.970
What's so secret that you can't even tell me?

22:32.460 --> 22:34.580
It's men's business, not for a woman like you.

22:36.880 --> 22:37.800
Online dating, huh?

22:38.310 --> 22:39.070
Who is it?

22:39.330 --> 22:40.320
Is it a guy or a girl?

22:40.320 --> 22:41.200
Good-looking?

22:41.200 --> 22:42.250
Any photos?

22:43.270 --> 22:45.110
It's bad enough that you're not trying to improve yourself.

22:45.110 --> 22:46.550
Why are you dragging Xingchi and Haikuo down too?

22:46.570 --> 22:47.990
You're being so selfish, you know?

22:47.990 --> 22:48.800
Xia Fenghua!

22:48.830 --> 22:50.400
Do you think just because you're a girl, I won't...

22:52.360 --> 22:53.200
That hurts!

22:53.200 --> 22:53.750
Are you nuts?

22:53.790 --> 22:54.870
Can't you be even a little ladylike?

22:55.870 --> 22:57.110
You guys just keep messing around.

22:57.140 --> 22:58.770
Your dads won't let you go when the grades come out.

22:58.810 --> 22:59.660
Whatever!

23:01.730 --> 23:03.870
How can she say we're messing around?

23:05.900 --> 23:06.630
Get out of my way.

23:10.910 --> 23:12.590
Even my dad can't control me. What makes you think you can?

23:35.150 --> 23:37.140
Do you know who Fenghua's idol is?

23:37.630 --> 23:38.360
Who is it?

23:38.590 --> 23:39.580
Chris.

23:40.700 --> 23:42.160
She's crazy about her.

23:42.160 --> 23:43.110
I made a snarky comment today,

23:43.150 --> 23:44.390
and she beat me up like this.

23:44.540 --> 23:46.100
She's still so obsessed?

23:46.590 --> 23:48.790
She was voting like crazy during the competition

23:48.810 --> 23:49.910
and even forced us to vote.

23:53.550 --> 23:55.080
So she's being a fangirl, huh?

23:56.180 --> 23:57.890
Let's give her a surprise then.

23:58.670 --> 23:59.430
What kind of surprise?

23:59.730 --> 24:01.990
Are you still the admin of the school forum?

24:02.750 --> 24:03.750
Yes. What's up?

24:08.740 --> 24:10.070
Listen...

24:14.890 --> 24:15.710
Will it work?

24:15.710 --> 24:16.730
It must work.

24:19.380 --> 24:21.960
[Chris Lee's QQ account was revealed by her life assistant.]

24:23.770 --> 24:24.430
Post it like this?

24:24.470 --> 24:25.400
Yes, just post it...

24:26.700 --> 24:28.850
[Chris Lee's QQ account was revealed by her life assistant.]

24:36.310 --> 24:37.310
Fenghua.

24:37.810 --> 24:39.240
Fenghua.

24:39.390 --> 24:40.360
You startled me.

24:40.390 --> 24:42.560
What are you so happy about?

24:42.700 --> 24:44.650
How can you study well like this?

24:45.050 --> 24:46.470
Chris added me on social media.

24:47.050 --> 24:47.860
What?

24:47.880 --> 24:49.160
Chris Lee!

24:49.390 --> 24:50.480
She just accepted

24:50.510 --> 24:51.830
my QQ friend request.

24:52.380 --> 24:54.360
How did you get her QQ contact?

24:54.470 --> 24:56.180
It was posted on the school forum.

24:56.350 --> 24:58.030
Some of us have already verified it.

24:58.110 --> 24:58.930
It's real.

24:59.430 --> 25:00.660
After she added me,

25:00.710 --> 25:02.150
she even said hello to me.

25:02.700 --> 25:04.280
So what?

25:04.760 --> 25:06.620
She added you and said hello.

25:06.650 --> 25:08.190
Can that get you into Peking University or Tsinghua?

25:08.220 --> 25:09.020
Try them on.

25:11.590 --> 25:13.390
I've altered the pant legs for you.

25:16.400 --> 25:17.020
Mom,

25:17.450 --> 25:18.320
this hole...

25:18.350 --> 25:19.160
I cut it

25:19.330 --> 25:21.230
and then used a brush to fray the edges.

25:21.470 --> 25:24.410
This style is just like the one in the fashion magazine.

25:24.590 --> 25:25.950
How's it? Looks chic, right?

25:26.390 --> 25:28.070
Not bad!

25:28.340 --> 25:28.970
Mom,

25:29.000 --> 25:31.380
with these skills, you could even do great in Paris!

25:31.710 --> 25:32.870
If I go to Paris,

25:32.870 --> 25:34.560
I can easily outdo your father.

25:35.430 --> 25:36.640
I'm glad you like it.

25:36.830 --> 25:38.120
We saved 200 yuan.

25:38.740 --> 25:40.130
I'll buy you a pair of shoes later.

25:41.940 --> 25:43.070
Just go try them on.

25:43.630 --> 25:44.260
Okay.

26:07.110 --> 26:08.240
Mr. Zhou!

26:08.780 --> 26:09.950
Here come your ingredients!

26:09.850 --> 26:11.510
[Flower Street]

26:12.510 --> 26:13.600
What did you bring me?

26:13.750 --> 26:15.110
Eggplant, green peppers, and tomatoes.

26:15.150 --> 26:15.990
I got 20 kilos of each.

26:16.010 --> 26:17.520
And 25 kilos of celery.

26:17.540 --> 26:18.180
Is that enough?

26:18.210 --> 26:19.280
Yes... That's plenty.

26:19.310 --> 26:21.190
Well, next week,

26:21.210 --> 26:21.960
cut them in half.

26:21.990 --> 26:22.720
Got it.

26:22.740 --> 26:23.420
I'm taking my leave.

26:23.460 --> 26:24.330
Okay...

26:27.700 --> 26:29.310
Let me give you a brief introduction.

26:29.340 --> 26:30.970
This is our second apprentice.

26:31.000 --> 26:32.650
He's in charge of preparing and organizing.

26:32.670 --> 26:33.800
He cuts ingredients.

26:34.630 --> 26:35.720
This way, please.

26:36.270 --> 26:37.030
This one,

26:37.030 --> 26:37.870
the slightly chubby one,

26:37.910 --> 26:38.860
is our third apprentice.

26:38.890 --> 26:40.030
He also does the chopping.

26:40.030 --> 26:40.990
Say hi.

26:41.010 --> 26:41.620
Hello.

26:41.970 --> 26:42.630
And look this way.

26:42.670 --> 26:43.990
This is our Master Ma,

26:44.020 --> 26:45.580
specifically in charge of wok tossing

26:45.870 --> 26:47.420
with outstanding skills.

26:47.460 --> 26:48.180
Master Ma,

26:48.210 --> 26:49.400
are the fish noodles ready?

26:49.440 --> 26:50.230
Yes!

26:50.260 --> 26:50.750
Be quick,

26:50.750 --> 26:52.140
or the noodles will get soggy and won't taste good.

26:52.190 --> 26:53.320
-Okay?
-Yeah, yes.

26:53.430 --> 26:54.040
This one

26:54.070 --> 26:55.420
needs to be tied tightly.

26:55.640 --> 26:57.190
Here, make sure to tie it tightly at the bottom.

26:57.240 --> 26:57.560
Okay.

26:57.590 --> 26:58.230
This one too.

26:58.250 --> 26:58.620
Alright.

26:58.670 --> 27:00.270
Just deliver it to this address.

27:00.270 --> 27:01.430
Okay...

27:01.450 --> 27:02.130
Got it.

27:04.000 --> 27:05.590
Here you are, hold it carefully.

27:06.070 --> 27:06.710
Yes...

27:06.740 --> 27:07.310
Be careful.

27:07.350 --> 27:07.830
I will...

27:07.870 --> 27:08.850
Alright...

27:08.950 --> 27:09.620
Take it slow on the road.

27:09.660 --> 27:10.370
Okay!

27:19.280 --> 27:21.340
Rice wine! Who wants some rice wine?

27:38.200 --> 27:39.350
Studying?

27:51.610 --> 27:52.550
If you have this much spare time,

27:52.550 --> 27:54.840
you might as well memorize a few more English words.

27:54.860 --> 27:55.670
I've finished that.

27:56.250 --> 27:57.700
Have you done your math homework?

27:57.720 --> 27:59.040
I finished it yesterday.

28:09.640 --> 28:11.080
Siyi hasn't come lately, has she?

28:11.110 --> 28:12.040
No,

28:12.480 --> 28:14.160
she hasn't shown up since that day.

28:18.610 --> 28:19.370
What's wrong?

28:20.130 --> 28:21.740
You should spend less time with her from now on.

28:22.360 --> 28:23.120
Why?

28:23.540 --> 28:24.890
Why so many questions?

28:25.590 --> 28:26.300
But...

28:26.600 --> 28:28.400
I just suggested

28:28.410 --> 28:30.270
she move in with us.

28:31.820 --> 28:33.130
It's for her own good.

28:33.180 --> 28:34.470
Don't you understand that?

28:34.510 --> 28:36.070
Those kids around her

28:36.070 --> 28:37.300
don't care about studying.

28:37.410 --> 28:39.830
I'm creating an opportunity for her

28:39.830 --> 28:41.230
to keep her distance from them.

28:41.940 --> 28:43.010
Mom,

28:43.180 --> 28:45.450
-are you crazy?
-Calm down.

28:58.160 --> 28:59.350
I'm doing this for your own good.

28:59.350 --> 29:00.750
I don't need it.

29:00.790 --> 29:02.990
Mom, I don't need it!

29:03.100 --> 29:05.240
Watch your mouth.

29:05.750 --> 29:08.480
Chen Rui, I know you're rebellious in puberty.

29:08.550 --> 29:09.800
You won't listen to your parents.

29:09.960 --> 29:11.680
But let me emphasize this again.

29:13.630 --> 29:16.260
From a farm girl with no background,

29:16.350 --> 29:17.510
I've fought my way to where I am today.

29:17.550 --> 29:18.950
What got me here?

29:19.110 --> 29:21.980
It was my incredible perseverance and self-discipline.

29:23.320 --> 29:24.570
You've gone too far!

29:34.740 --> 29:35.970
She's coming...

29:36.010 --> 29:36.960
There she comes...

30:17.140 --> 30:17.990
Chris,

30:18.240 --> 30:19.210
are you busy right now?

30:24.990 --> 30:25.870
It's okay.

30:26.220 --> 30:27.370
I'm recording songs

30:28.100 --> 30:29.880
for a new album.

30:43.340 --> 30:44.480
I'm looking forward to it.

30:47.920 --> 30:49.780
She's even acting cute.

30:57.460 --> 31:00.780
I'll be holding a concert in Chengdu next month.

31:00.820 --> 31:02.740
Can you come?

31:22.600 --> 31:23.320
Yes.

31:24.940 --> 31:26.300
Seriously?

31:33.270 --> 31:34.780
That's great.

31:34.970 --> 31:36.800
See you in Chengdu then.

31:36.980 --> 31:38.470
I'll be waiting for you.

31:41.460 --> 31:43.080
That scared me.

31:48.310 --> 31:49.490
It's a date.

32:00.140 --> 32:02.440
This girl will definitely come to borrow money from us soon.

32:02.460 --> 32:03.220
Do you believe it?

32:03.150 --> 32:06.790
[Cyber Surfing Café]

32:07.790 --> 32:09.150
You're laughing too loud!

32:10.750 --> 32:12.090
I don't have any money anyway.

32:12.120 --> 32:13.000
He has money!

32:13.030 --> 32:13.880
I don't.

32:13.920 --> 32:14.310
You don't?

32:14.310 --> 32:15.350
Look at your Max sneakers.

32:15.390 --> 32:16.310
Don't wear them anymore, okay?

32:16.310 --> 32:16.840
The heels are high.

32:16.870 --> 32:17.750
What are you doing?

32:19.080 --> 32:20.530
What's the matter?

32:20.560 --> 32:22.650
I've been curious about something.

32:23.670 --> 32:24.680
Go ahead.

32:24.790 --> 32:27.850
How many bones do you think a person has?

32:27.980 --> 32:29.100
If they're broken,

32:29.120 --> 32:30.890
how long would it take to heal?

32:33.790 --> 32:35.010
You...

32:35.680 --> 32:37.330
What do you mean?

32:40.110 --> 32:40.590
Stop...

32:40.630 --> 32:41.030
Fenghua...

32:41.030 --> 32:41.830
Let go!

32:41.890 --> 32:45.900
[Chatting with Fenghua]

32:48.390 --> 32:49.850
Do you think I'm a fool?

32:50.120 --> 32:50.710
Fenghua.

32:50.790 --> 32:51.590
He was just joking with you.

32:51.590 --> 32:52.300
How did you find out?

32:52.300 --> 32:53.850
Are you making a fool of me?

33:01.790 --> 33:02.670
I know.

33:04.640 --> 33:06.350
None of you like Chris.

33:07.830 --> 33:09.060
It's okay.

33:09.170 --> 33:11.340
No one is forcing you to like her.

33:11.980 --> 33:14.150
But you have no right

33:15.430 --> 33:17.280
to mock someone else's choices.

33:19.050 --> 33:20.290
Yes,

33:20.690 --> 33:22.680
I may not have the money

33:22.870 --> 33:25.010
to afford a concert ticket today.

33:25.060 --> 33:26.790
But one day,

33:26.860 --> 33:28.030
Chris will

33:28.070 --> 33:29.870
hold a concert in the world's

33:29.910 --> 33:31.070
largest stadium!

33:31.490 --> 33:32.740
And I,

33:33.380 --> 33:35.660
I will be able to afford

33:35.690 --> 33:37.450
a front-row seat by myself.

33:38.190 --> 33:40.350
I'll sit in the closest position to her,

33:40.380 --> 33:41.950
listening to her sing.

33:42.450 --> 33:44.810
This is the most serious promise

33:45.090 --> 33:46.900
I make to my future self!

33:48.450 --> 33:49.180
Fenghua.

33:49.210 --> 33:49.770
Fenghua.

33:49.790 --> 33:50.230
Fenghua!

33:50.260 --> 33:50.700
Fenghua!

33:50.730 --> 33:51.970
-Fenghua!
-Fenghua!

35:02.930 --> 35:04.600
Stinky tofu.

35:14.460 --> 35:15.330
What's wrong?

35:16.600 --> 35:17.730
Did you cry?

35:18.140 --> 35:18.980
No.

35:19.550 --> 35:21.150
Then why do you look so dejected?

35:22.760 --> 35:24.010
What happened?

35:24.030 --> 35:25.150
Really, it's nothing.

35:25.470 --> 35:26.110
Tell me.

35:29.760 --> 35:30.400
Mom,

35:31.630 --> 35:33.860
I just saw Siyi.

35:34.270 --> 35:36.520
I think she's working at Uncle Zhou's shop.

35:36.690 --> 35:37.750
What kind of work?

35:39.480 --> 35:41.170
It seemed to be food delivery.

35:41.190 --> 35:43.100
I hid and didn't dare to ask her.

35:43.140 --> 35:44.460
What's wrong with delivering food?

35:44.480 --> 35:45.870
Do you think it's a shame?

35:46.130 --> 35:47.080
Not at all.

35:47.150 --> 35:48.470
That's it!

35:48.750 --> 35:50.660
If she's not troubled,

35:50.680 --> 35:52.230
why didn't she tell me?

35:53.200 --> 35:54.740
You're so young,

35:54.780 --> 35:56.900
yet your mind is full of twists and turns.

35:56.920 --> 35:58.340
You've watched too many TV dramas.

36:00.590 --> 36:02.200
Siyi always thinks too much

36:02.550 --> 36:05.030
and keeps everything to herself when she encounters difficulties.

36:05.800 --> 36:07.450
I really don't want to add to her stress.

36:07.470 --> 36:09.540
Madam, I want some mung bean cakes, please.

36:09.840 --> 36:10.710
Coming right up!

36:11.780 --> 36:13.460
If you're real besties,

36:13.480 --> 36:15.290
you'd better show some sincerity.

36:15.990 --> 36:17.070
Avoiding it

36:17.190 --> 36:18.590
won't fix anything.

36:19.330 --> 36:20.370
How old are you?

36:22.810 --> 36:23.690
None of your business.

36:27.710 --> 36:28.760
What are you doing?

36:29.510 --> 36:31.400
You really are photogenic.

36:42.910 --> 36:43.650
Siyi.

36:45.670 --> 36:47.590
This is our homemade salted pork.

36:47.590 --> 36:49.630
Use it to make a dish for your grandma tomorrow.

36:49.660 --> 36:50.630
No, thanks.

36:51.470 --> 36:52.910
It's for your grandma,

36:52.940 --> 36:54.180
not for you.

36:54.210 --> 36:55.010
Just take it.

36:55.910 --> 36:57.150
Thank you, Uncle Zhou.

36:57.180 --> 36:58.060
I'll head back now.

36:58.080 --> 36:58.610
OK.

36:58.990 --> 36:59.750
Be careful on your way.

36:59.780 --> 37:00.510
OK.

37:28.740 --> 37:29.710
Fenghua,

37:29.710 --> 37:31.780
you really scared me!

37:34.010 --> 37:35.070
Where have you been?

37:36.590 --> 37:37.310
The library.

37:38.880 --> 37:39.700
Nah,

37:39.720 --> 37:41.040
it doesn't smell like the library.

37:41.080 --> 37:43.310
It smells more like kitchen grease from a restaurant.

37:43.330 --> 37:44.250
Huaiyang cuisine.

37:44.770 --> 37:46.050
Go away.

37:46.850 --> 37:49.450
Is it worth working part-time at the cost of your studies?

37:53.250 --> 37:54.530
Don't worry,

37:55.050 --> 37:56.180
I won't tell your grandma.

37:58.630 --> 38:00.270
How did you know that?

38:02.320 --> 38:04.760
Your hair smells like kitchen grease,

38:08.620 --> 38:10.640
and your hands smell like dish soap.

38:13.700 --> 38:14.620
And this.

38:15.470 --> 38:16.400
Did you buy it at the library?

38:18.740 --> 38:21.000
Don't tell anyone else, anyway.

38:21.030 --> 38:21.910
I won't say anything.

38:21.940 --> 38:23.700
Aren't you afraid Uncle Zhou will tell your grandma?

38:23.720 --> 38:24.470
He won't.

38:24.510 --> 38:26.210
I made him promise to keep it a secret.

38:29.350 --> 38:30.190
I have a better idea

38:30.190 --> 38:31.470
to make money.

38:31.490 --> 38:32.320
Want to give it a try?

38:32.950 --> 38:33.870
Not interested.

38:34.150 --> 38:34.910
Really?

38:34.930 --> 38:36.690
We received a photographer at my mother's stall.

38:36.720 --> 38:38.600
He said being a model makes money really fast.

38:38.950 --> 38:39.750
Model?

38:41.100 --> 38:41.980
Come on, let's go to my place.

38:42.000 --> 38:43.130
I'll show you.

38:46.880 --> 38:49.880
This guy takes photos for ads.

38:49.970 --> 38:51.730
He saw me and said I was photogenic enough

38:51.750 --> 38:53.300
to be a print model.

38:53.490 --> 38:56.410
A set of photos can be done in just a few hours.

38:56.450 --> 38:58.330
Eight hundred yuan, paid in cash.

39:01.490 --> 39:03.130
Sounds fishy.

39:05.610 --> 39:07.250
Fine, you'll see.

39:11.890 --> 39:13.900
Look, he took these random photos of me.

39:16.430 --> 39:17.440
What do you think?

39:18.270 --> 39:20.410
His skills are pretty good.

39:21.050 --> 39:23.310
The skills are not the key.

39:23.430 --> 39:24.700
It's all thanks to my good looks.

39:24.730 --> 39:25.740
I look great in anyone's camera.

39:30.740 --> 39:32.030
Are you really planning to try?

39:33.130 --> 39:34.440
It doesn't hurt to try.

39:34.660 --> 39:36.200
He has a studio in the city.

39:36.670 --> 39:38.230
I'll find time to check it out later.

39:40.190 --> 39:41.150
Would you go with me?

39:42.310 --> 39:43.710
He invited you.

39:43.730 --> 39:44.980
Why should I go?

39:46.470 --> 39:48.360
I'm a bit scared to go alone.

39:48.450 --> 39:49.810
What if it's a scam?

39:50.440 --> 39:52.160
Then ask Wanghe and the others to go with you.

39:53.490 --> 39:54.370
No.

39:55.030 --> 39:56.560
I'll have to pose for the photos.

39:56.590 --> 39:57.630
If those three see me like that,

39:57.650 --> 39:58.800
I'd die of embarrassment.

40:03.470 --> 40:05.190
Go with me, please.

40:05.390 --> 40:06.270
Let's go together

40:06.290 --> 40:07.240
and earn 800 per week.

40:07.270 --> 40:08.920
That's over 3,000 a month!

40:08.960 --> 40:10.730
Isn't that better than working at the restaurant?

40:14.420 --> 40:15.600
Don't worry.

40:15.670 --> 40:17.940
He even thinks I'm pretty.

40:18.080 --> 40:18.990
So imagine how he'll see you.

40:19.960 --> 40:20.990
You can take

40:21.020 --> 40:23.680
a few more sets and post them online later.

40:23.940 --> 40:26.090
You might become a famous model!

40:26.120 --> 40:28.280
Then you could charge several thousand for a set

40:28.440 --> 40:30.920
with your photos all over those websites.

40:30.960 --> 40:33.230
People might ask for your autograph on the street.

40:33.660 --> 40:36.290
Even Jay Chou might want you to star in his music videos.

40:40.160 --> 40:41.370
I'll think about it.

40:53.030 --> 40:53.840
Ms. Liang.

40:54.840 --> 40:55.630
Siyi.

40:56.830 --> 40:57.750
Let me help you.

40:57.770 --> 40:59.020
No, thanks. It's too heavy.

40:59.050 --> 41:00.420
So don't bother. I'll handle it.

41:00.750 --> 41:01.390
It's okay.

41:02.750 --> 41:03.370
You...

41:08.750 --> 41:09.760
Let me take it.

41:13.270 --> 41:13.870
Goodbye, then.

41:13.890 --> 41:14.660
Wait...

41:14.690 --> 41:16.770
Come in and have some water. C'mon.

41:21.820 --> 41:22.580
Take a seat.

41:23.800 --> 41:24.760
Where's Wanghe?

41:26.360 --> 41:27.730
Who knows?

41:27.760 --> 41:29.620
He's hanging out all the time, never at home.

41:30.450 --> 41:31.140
Here.

41:31.470 --> 41:32.480
Thank you.

41:32.810 --> 41:34.590
If he were as sensible as you,

41:34.670 --> 41:36.650
I would wake up laughing from my dreams.

41:37.050 --> 41:38.630
He just doesn't like studying.

41:38.660 --> 41:39.890
He'd surely score high if he were into it.

41:40.140 --> 41:41.400
Let him be.

41:41.650 --> 41:43.500
As long as he can graduate from high school.

41:45.520 --> 41:46.250
What about you?

41:46.670 --> 41:48.310
Have you decided which university to apply for?

41:48.630 --> 41:49.890
Honghuai Normal University.

41:51.800 --> 41:52.810
Is it a key university?

41:54.060 --> 41:56.380
It's second-tier, but close to home.

41:56.410 --> 41:58.050
I can come home every week to be with my grandma.

42:12.400 --> 42:13.280
Good girl.

42:16.510 --> 42:17.270
But...

42:18.560 --> 42:19.950
Being too sensible isn't always good.

42:20.440 --> 42:23.400
You might suffer a lot in your life.

42:31.230 --> 42:32.030
Just drink it.

42:32.700 --> 42:33.830
Thank you, Ms. Liang.

42:33.870 --> 42:34.750
I'll take my leave.

42:35.980 --> 42:36.740
Bye-bye.

42:37.370 --> 42:38.480
Have a good rest!
